Text:
fearlessOnClick is a program that the desk runs when a person opens a file, for example with a double click.
fearlessOnClick is also the program that calls reconciliator$reconcile, so that the desk runs fearlessOnClick for those files.
fearlessOnClick turns the path that the desk gives into a Base16, and runs fearlessMessage.
fearlessOnClick sends only Messages that any other program can send.
//later: what a person sees when fearlessMessage prints on its standard error
//later: what a person sees after a "Register " Base16 that is applied
//later: a person who does not let fearlessOnClick open the files of an extension that is not of form FearlessExtension is asked again at the next reconcile

Story:
A event fearlessOnClick starts with the one argument "Reconcile".
B action fearlessOnClick runs fearlessMessage with the one argument "Extensions"
C fact fearlessMessage prints "Applied\n" OSExtension1 "\n" .. OSExtensionn "\n"
D fact OSExtensions holds exactly OSExtension1 .. OSExtensionn and every OSExtension of form FearlessExtension.
E fact TaggedText encodes the path of this fearlessOnClick.
F action reconciliator$reconcile(TaggedText,OSExtensions) ends with done.

