Story:
A action fearlessOnClick runs fearlessMessage with the one argument Message
B fact fearlessMessage prints "Refused\n" Error
C action fearlessOnClick shows Error in a dialog

Implementation notes:
On macOS the desk hands the files to open to fearlessOnClick in an open event; on the other desks the desk runs fearlessOnClick with the path of each file as an argument.
On macOS the desk starts fearlessOnClick with no argument before that open event, so "no argument" can not mean "reconcile". The argument "Reconcile" is not a path that a desk passes: such a path is absolute.
When the desk opens several files at once, the Story happens once for each file.
